 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Send them an invite with photo of the couple and a short story about why you chose your guests. Say you' keeping the guest list under 30 and the venue requires notification a year in advance. Then send her the story instead of the invite. Say you' send the invitation right up until the big day. That way everyone knows and she can stop bothering. Give the story to her first. If she' still upset, send the invitation privately few days before. It depends on your church. Some ban it after the big day. And send the story to all your work friends on the day of the ceremony. A good story about the couple makes the drinks justifyable.",
